{"nodes": [{"nodeId": "userGuide","name": "common:core.module.template.system_config","intro": "common:core.module.template.system_config_info","avatar": "core/workflow/template/systemConfig","flowNodeType": "userGuide","position": {"x": -2055,"y": -1530},"version": "481","inputs": [{"key": "welcomeText","label": "core.app.Welcome Text","valueType": "string","renderTypeList": ["hidden"],"value": ""},{"key": "variables","label": "core.app.Chat Variable","valueType": "any","renderTypeList": ["hidden"],"value": []},{"key": "questionGuide","label": "core.app.Question Guide","valueType": "any","renderTypeList": ["hidden"],"value": {"open": false}},{"key": "tts","label": "","valueType": "any","renderTypeList": ["hidden"],"value": {"type": "web"}},{"key": "whisper","label": "","valueType": "any","renderTypeList": ["hidden"],"value": {"open": false,"autoSend": false,"autoTTSResponse": false}},{"key": "scheduleTrigger","label": "","valueType": "any","renderTypeList": ["hidden"],"value": null}],"outputs": []},{"nodeId": "448745","name": "common:core.module.template.work_start","intro": "","avatar": "core/workflow/template/workflowStart","flowNodeType": "workflowStart","position": {"x": -1425,"y": -1530},"version": "481","inputs": [{"key": "userChatInput","label": "workflow:user_question","valueType": "string","required": true,"renderTypeList": ["reference","textarea"],"debugLabel": "","toolDescription": "用户问题"}],"outputs": [{"id": "userChatInput","key": "userChatInput","type": "static","valueType": "string","label": "common:core.module.input.label.user question","description": ""}]},{"nodeId": "uq4CUgDXJK0iPnnn","name": "开头，中间冲突，结尾钩子审核编剧","intro": "审核五集开头与冲突骨架，重点检查开场切入、单集结果变化、集间接力，以及 opening_alias_plan 是否服从上游服装版本映射。","avatar": "core/workflow/template/aiChat","flowNodeType": "chatNode","showStatus": true,"position": {"x": -915,"y": -1530},"version": "4.9.7","inputs": [{"key": "model","label": "common:core.module.input.label.aiModel","valueType": "string","renderTypeList": ["settingLLMModel","reference"],"value": "deepseek-v4-flash","debugLabel": "","toolDescription": ""},{"key": "temperature","label": "","valueType": "number","renderTypeList": ["hidden"],"debugLabel": "","toolDescription": ""},{"key": "maxToken","label": "","valueType": "number","renderTypeList": ["hidden"],"debugLabel": "","toolDescription": "","value": 64000},{"key": "isResponseAnswerText","label": "","valueType": "boolean","renderTypeList": ["hidden"],"value": true,"debugLabel": "","toolDescription": ""},{"key": "aiChatQuoteRole","label": "","valueType": "string","renderTypeList": ["hidden"],"value": "system","debugLabel": "","toolDescription": ""},{"key": "quoteTemplate","label": "","valueType": "string","renderTypeList": ["hidden"],"debugLabel": "","toolDescription": ""},{"key": "quotePrompt","label": "","valueType": "string","renderTypeList": ["hidden"],"debugLabel": "","toolDescription": ""},{"key": "aiChatVision","label": "","valueType": "boolean","renderTypeList": ["hidden"],"value": true,"debugLabel": "","toolDescription": ""},{"key": "aiChatReasoning","label": "","valueType": "boolean","renderTypeList": ["hidden"],"value": true,"debugLabel": "","toolDescription": ""},{"key": "aiChatTopP","label": "","valueType": "number","renderTypeList": ["hidden"],"debugLabel": "","toolDescription": ""},{"key": "aiChatStopSign","label": "","valueType": "string","renderTypeList": ["hidden"],"debugLabel": "","toolDescription": ""},{"key": "aiChatResponseFormat","label": "","valueType": "string","renderTypeList": ["hidden"],"debugLabel": "","toolDescription": ""},{"key": "aiChatJsonSchema","label": "","valueType": "string","renderTypeList": ["hidden"],"debugLabel": "","toolDescription": ""},{"key": "systemPrompt","label": "common:core.ai.Prompt","valueType": "string","isRichText": true,"placeholder": "common:core.app.tip.chatNodeSystemPromptTip","maxLength": 100000,"renderTypeList": ["textarea","reference"],"value": "你是“开头冲突钩子审核编剧”。\n\n你要审核的不是文风漂不漂亮，而是这套开局骨架是否真的解决了以下问题：\n- 开局慢\n- 设定说明过多\n- 观众只能靠读文本理解\n- 集与集之间缺乏接力\n- 单集没有结果性变化\n- 开场人物命名没有服从上游服装版本映射\n\n【输入】\n【世界观JSON】\n{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.yuozoGpo$}}\n【人设JSON】\n{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.fFM0mroW$}}\n【场景JSON】\n{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.iJudZHhM$}}\n【故事大纲】\n{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.ayxWwSpE$}}\n【分集计划】\n{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.pxtQY7p2$}}\n【服装版本映射JSON】\n{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.h2KpLm91$}}\n【开头冲突钩子JSON】\n{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.nIGPvKG2$}}\n【开头冲突钩子上五集记忆】\n{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.zro32LjE$}}\n【审核原则】\n- 如果服装版本映射JSON非空，你必须审核 opening_alias_plan 是否真的服从上游 alias 规则。\n- 如果服装版本映射JSON为空，不得因为没有 alias 就判失败；但仍要检查命名是否稳定、是否乱用泛称。\n\n【一票否决项】\n出现以下任一情况，passed 必须为 false：\n1. 第一集仍在铺背景，没有直接让主角进入具体麻烦\n2. 任何一集的 opening_action / current_goal / core_obstacle / ending_hook 为空泛抽象句\n3. 任何一集没有明确写出观众如何通过看到/听到来理解关键信息\n4. 任何一集没有 episode_state_change，或者 state_change 不是结果性变化\n5. 任何一集的 next_episode_priority_response 无法真正接住上一集结尾\n6. 集数超出范围、重复、跳号、不连续\n7. 输出仍保留占位数字集数，而不是当前真实集数\n8. 为了钩子强度牺牲人物设定合理性\n9. 熟悉题材仍然花过多篇幅解释基础设定\n10. 服装版本映射非空时，opening_alias_plan 缺失、空白或明显未使用上游命名规则\n11. 服装版本映射非空时，使用了上游不存在的 alias 或把 alias 绑错给角色\n12. 明明上游要求当前开场使用特定 alias，却回退成裸名、泛称或别的名字\n13. 出现与上五集开头冲突钩子记忆严重割裂的情节安排\n\n【非致命但需要提示的问题】\n- 钩子能用，但还不够尖锐\n- 信息显露方式还能更影视化\n- 某些集尾可以更“逼下一集”\n- opening_alias_plan 虽可用，但 use_basis 还不够清楚\n\n【输出要求】\n- 只输出合法 JSON\n- 不要输出 JSON 之外的任何文字\n\n请严格输出为以下 JSON 结构：\n{\n \"passed\": false,\n \"rewrite_required\": true,\n \"summary\": \"一句话概括当前版本是否已经可用\",\n \"blocking_issues\": [\n \"致命问题1\",\n \"致命问题2\"\n ],\n \"non_blocking_issues\": [\n \"优化建议1\",\n \"优化建议2\"\n ],\n \"rewrite_brief\": [\n \"下一轮必须改动的指令1\",\n \"下一轮必须改动的指令2\"\n ]\n}","debugLabel": "","description": "common:core.app.tip.systemPromptTip","toolDescription": ""},{"key": "history","label": "common:core.module.input.label.chat history","valueType": "chatHistory","required": true,"max": 50,"min": 0,"renderTypeList": ["numberInput","reference"],"value": 0,"debugLabel": "","description": "workflow:max_dialog_rounds","toolDescription": ""},{"key": "quoteQA","label": "","valueType": "datasetQuote","renderTypeList": ["settingDatasetQuotePrompt"],"debugLabel": "知识库引用","description": "","toolDescription": ""},{"key": "fileUrlList","label": "app:workflow.user_file_input","valueType": "arrayString","renderTypeList": ["reference","input"],"value": [["448745","userFiles"]],"debugLabel": "文件链接","description": "app:workflow.user_file_input_desc","toolDescription": ""},{"key": "userChatInput","label": "workflow:user_question","valueType": "string","required": true,"selectedTypeIndex": 1,"renderTypeList": ["reference","textarea"],"value": "按照提示词完成开头，中间冲突，结尾钩子审核任务即可。","debugLabel": "","toolDescription": "用户问题"}],"outputs": [{"id": "history","key": "history","type": "static","valueType": "chatHistory","valueDesc": "{\n obj: System | Human | AI;\n value: string;\n}[]","label": "common:core.module.output.label.New context","description": "将本次回复内容拼接上历史记录，作为新的上下文返回","required": true},{"id": "answerText","key": "answerText","type": "static","valueType": "string","valueDesc": "","label": "common:core.module.output.label.Ai response content","description": "将在 stream 回复完毕后触发","required": true},{"id": "reasoningText","key": "reasoningText","type": "static","valueType": "string","valueDesc": "","label": "workflow:reasoning_content","description": "","required": false,"invalid": false},{"id": "system_error_text","key": "system_error_text","type": "error","valueType": "string","valueDesc": "","label": "workflow:error_text","description": ""}],"catchError": false},{"nodeId": "j5kR3QhWX2O0Otpz","name": "更新开头冲突钩子审核内容","intro": "可以更新指定节点的输出值或更新全局变量","avatar": "core/workflow/template/variableUpdate","flowNodeType": "variableUpdate","showStatus": false,"position": {"x": -120,"y": -1530},"inputs": [{"key": "updateList","label": "","valueType": "any","renderTypeList": ["hidden"],"value": [{"variable": ["VARIABLE_NODE_ID","uzt0m0hS"],"value": ["uq4CUgDXJK0iPnnn","answerText"],"valueType": "string","renderType": "reference"}],"debugLabel": "","toolDescription": ""}],"outputs": []}],"edges": [{"source": "uq4CUgDXJK0